.varve/

# Claude Code's project-scoped MCP config. Conventionally committed so a team
# is wired on clone — but `varve setup` writes an absolute path to the binary
# (deliberately: the agent host spawns the server in a non-interactive
# environment where the user's PATH does not apply), and that path is true on
# exactly one machine. Committing it hands every teammate a command only the
# author can run. Each clone runs `varve setup` instead.
.mcp.json
